# 🚀 Role-Based Authentication (RBAC) with JWT and Gin Framework

## 📖 What is RBAC?

**RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)** is a security mechanism that grants access to resources based on a user's role.

Instead of giving permissions to individual users, permissions are assigned to roles.

---

# 🌟 Why RBAC?

* Better Security
* Easy User Management
* Scalable Applications
* Fine-Grained Access Control

---

# 👥 Example Roles

| Role    | Permissions                  |
| ------- | ---------------------------- |
| Admin   | Create, Read, Update, Delete |
| Teacher | Read, Update                 |
| Student | Read Only                    |
| Guest   | Limited Access               |

---

# 🔐 Authentication vs Authorization vs RBAC

| Feature        | Purpose                  |
| -------------- | ------------------------ |
| Authentication | Verify User Identity     |
| Authorization  | Verify User Permission   |
| RBAC           | Permission Based on Role |

